+The clinic publishes the veterinarians it employs with the specialties each holds, listed a page at a time. A veterinarian holding no specialty is shown as having none rather than left blank `[REQ-VET-001]`. The directory is published on two surfaces: the browser page readers use, and a machine-readable form of the same list; both are supported.
